4
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:18,000
Frustrated, the man lost his patience and called a duck into the story.

5
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,480
The little duck tried her best for the prince.

6
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:26,120
She transcended her standing in the world and came to love the prince.

7
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,460
However, she was only a duck.

8
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:32,980
She was fated to someday turn into a speck of light and vanish.

9
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:38,620
Yes, that was the tear-jerking ending the story had decided on.

10
00:02:26,437 --> 00:02:31,437
And so, the prince and the princess lived happily ever... happily.

11
00:02:31,437 --> 00:02:37,437
